  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (SD1607(P)01, SD1607(P)02, SD1607(P)03, SD1607(P)14-A, SD1607(P)15, SD1607(P)16-A, SD1607(P)17, Design & Access Statement dated 16 December 2016. Received: 22/12/2016) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - Separate access to the residential accommodation on the upper floors of the premises shall be available to residents at all times.",
    "Condition : 5 - No fans, louvres, ducts or other external plant shall be installed without the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - The use hereby permitted shall not be open to customers outside the following times, 07:00 to 23:00 Monday to Saturday and 09:00 to 20:00 on Sundays and Bank or Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 7 - No deliveries shall be taken at or despatched from the site outside the hours of 08:00 - 23:00 nor at any time on Sundays, Bank or Public Holidays.",
    "Condition : 8 - The windows formed in the southern flank elevation shall be obscure glazed, hinged to open inwards and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 9 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for the ventilation of the premises of an appropriate outlet level, including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant and the standard or dilution expected has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 10 - No waste and recycling bins shall be left outside the building at any time other than for collection.",
    "Condition : 11 - Before the use hereby approved commences, full details (including manufacturers' specifications) of secure covered cycle parking facilities (for not less than 2 bicycles) for the staff and visitors of the development have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved facilities shall conform to current guidance such as the TfL London Cycling Design Standards in design and layout and be fully implemented and be made available for use before the first occupation of the development and thereafter retained for use at all times without obstruction.",
    "Condition : 12 - Before the development hereby permitted is occupied, arrangements shall be agreed in writing with the local planning authority and be put in place to ensure that, with the exception of disabled persons, no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the area at any time.",
    "Condition : 13 - The access doorway to the restaurant shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor, a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level and glass entrance doors and glazed screens must be clearly defined with manifestation on the glass at two levels: 850 mm to 1000 mm and 1400 mm to 1600 mm. The manifestation should be a sign or logo at least 150 mm high.",
    "Condition : 14 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced, details of CCTV locations and management, signage, and lighting, demonstrating that the side access offers residents a safe and well-lit route to their front door, shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved details shall be installed prior to the occupation of the development and maintained thereafter."
  ],
